Exercice 1 (4 points) — Donner la trace de mystere(5) :
int mystere(int n){ return n<=1 ? 1 : n*mystere(n-1); }
Réponse : 120.

SELECT s.nom, AVG(n.note) AS moy
FROM notes n JOIN students s ON s.id = n.student_id
GROUP BY s.nom HAVING AVG(n.note) >= 12;
